{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":122,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"c5b79941-7cff-4fd0-888f-1382835d40b1","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351622159,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【杭州桐庐支行】理财经理","OrgId":1180939,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"（一）严格按照国家法律法规和行内各项规章制度及业务政策办理业务，遵守理财经理日常规范。\n\n（二）为客户提供个性化的投资建议和资产配置方案，实现客户财富的保值增值；完成贵宾理财客户金融资产维护工作，做好优质客户的增值服务。\n\n（三）多种渠道拓展优质客户，完成行内各类产品的业绩指标。\n\n（四）负责系统客户信息维护录入工作，实现客户精细化管理。","Require":"（一）年龄在35周岁及以下，全日制本科及以上学历，金融行业从业5年以上，且有2年及以上相关理财经理工作经验。\n\n（二）熟悉个人金融服务所涉及的银行业务、投资产品、操作流程；具备理财从业资格，银行从业记录信誉良好。\n\n（三）具备销售技巧和较强的服务意识，良好的沟通及问题解决能力，有团队合作精神；\n\n（四）持有银行理财、基金、保险等从业资格，持有AFP、CFP者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-21T17:15:17","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"f064b3ea-16d3-4b06-b17a-3bc2e0299312","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351621649,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-